OL,3,GNEWSAMum fundraising for terminally ill
OL,4,Adaughter
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I can't put terminal and her together,
OL,7,Fthey just don't match," the mother of a
OL,8,Ftwo-year-old girl with a rare and
OL,9,Faggressive cancer has said.
OL,11,FAlicia, from Totton, said her daughter
OL,12,FBetty was diagnosed with incurable,
OL,13,Fstage four metastatic neuroblastoma
OL,14,Fcancer in July.
OL,16,FNow the family is trying to raise
OL,17,F#520,000 for Betty to undergo
OL,18,Fspecialist treatment in Barcelona.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
