OL,3,GNEWSAMum fundraising for terminally ill
OL,4,Adaughter
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC Radio Solent, Alicia
OL,7,Fsaid: "She's my only child, she was my
OL,8,Fabsolute miracle and I've got to do
OL,9,Fwhat I can as a parent to try and get
OL,10,Fher out there for the treatment."
